                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "~\nSteam needs a median mark. I really like how this game is setup with the progression and all. I can grind it out with the best of em; but unfortunately in shooters or \"schmup\" i reach a wall skill wise and don't have the memory capacity for bullet hell routes. If your an averagely skilled player like myself then I'd guess you'd tire out when I have after unlocking the last ship and beating stage 3 on hard. The final ship should come with it's final spread and not be something you have to maintain by not being hit. Level 4 is just ridiculous bullet hell wise. All and all this just ends up feeling like someone's \"gem\" i can't fully appreciate.",
